WEBVTT

00:21.320 --> 00:22.720
Sheng'er

00:24.920 --> 00:26.320
You've grown up

00:31.520 --> 00:32.920
Father

00:33.720 --> 00:35.720
Your son truly had no choice

00:36.320 --> 00:37.200
For all under heaven

00:37.280 --> 00:38.680
For the people's peace

00:39.280 --> 00:41.280
Your son had no other way

00:42.920 --> 00:44.520
The 22nd year of Longwu

00:44.600 --> 00:46.640
Sikong Yao announced his abdication

00:46.720 --> 00:48.600
The crown prince ascended the throne

00:48.680 --> 00:51.160
Honored Sikong Yao as Retired Emperor


00:53.000 --> 01:00.500
Yet not long after, the Second Prince raised troops under the pretext that Sikong Sheng had imprisoned the Retired Emperor, plunging Great Xuan once more into civil turmoil.

01:01.000 --> 01:09.500
The following year, the southern capital of Xuan was breached and Great Xuan collapsed. Retired Emperor Sikong Yao was taken captive and escorted to the Wunu capital, forced to pour wine in servant's robes. Ultimately unable to endure such humiliation, he hanged himself.

01:10.000 --> 01:16.500
According to historical records, later generations remembered Sikong Yao as...
